kubeos-cli (1.0.0-1kubeos2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Stop dh_installsystemd from enabling and starting/restarting units by itself. It
    were enabling flanneld.service - which hook 9050 documents as never-to-enable, since
    it cannot run as a host service - and it restarted units on every upgrade, including
    control-plane units that must not start before node-setup has written the PKI. The
    .wants links shipped in the package now decide, and nothing else.

 -- KubeOS <mail@kubeos.in>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:20:00 +0530

kubeos-cli (1.0.0-1kubeos1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging. The scripts and the systemd units are the ones the KubeOS
    ISO shipped in config/includes.chroot, unchanged; the units move from
    /etc/systemd/system to /usr/lib/systemd/system because they are package-owned
    now, and the .wants links are shipped as files instead of being created by a
    build hook (systemctl enable in a postinst aborts a chroot build).

 -- KubeOS <mail@kubeos.in>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:40:00 +0530
